---
description: |
  Investigations-plane scope of the record_integrity verification walk —
  the thin binding over the shared operator
  ([`../../record_integrity/verify.tql`](../../record_integrity/verify.tql)),
  which owns the recompute, the chain walk, and the finding shape.
  Scope: the walk is unwindowed (the investigations store is read whole
  — a chain head referencing a predecessor the walk never saw is a
  deletion), and findings dress as the investigations product over the
  per-case chains (chain_uid = metadata.correlation_uid). The
  investigations-attest-verify pipeline calls this hourly (the every
  wrapper) and writes break findings into ocsf.Detection_Finding to ride
  the Grafana rails (docs/issues/
  tenzir-record-integrity-attestations.md, landed).
---

homelab::record_integrity::verify product="homelab-investigations",
  title="Investigations record chain break",
  uid_prefix="investigations",
  scope_word="case",
  windowed=false
